|-------------|---------------|---------|---------------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | `postgres://admin:CANARY-***` | Database connection | 🔴 Critical - Contains credentials |
| `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` | `AKIA-CANARY1234567890` | AWS authentication | 🔴 Critical - Cloud access |
