## 📊 Secrets Management Comparison

| Approach | Pros | Cons | Best For |
|----------|------|------|----------|
| **.env files** | Simple, dev-friendly | Risk of committing, no rotation | Local development |
| **AWS Secrets Manager** | Auto-rotation, audit logs | Cost, AWS dependency | Production |
| **HashiCorp Vault** | Feature-rich, multi-cloud | Complex setup | Enterprise |
| **Kubernetes Secrets** | Native to K8s | Base64 encoded (not encrypted) | Containerized apps |
| **Environment Variables** | Runtime only | Harder to manage, no versioning | All environments |

